L000922	By contrast, the antialigned case (A4) shows a higher peak amplitude in
L000923	the magnetized simulation, driven by strong instability and enhanced accretion triggered by MRI-induced
L000924	turbulence. This rapid accretion amplifies the GW emission, consistent with the stronger PPI growth
L000925	observed in magnetized A4
